# Wrangler uploads every file under the assets directory and does not read
# .gitignore, so anything ignored there has to be repeated here. Without this,
# files kept out of git as private still ship to the edge. Today the preview
# Access app covers the whole workers.dev hostname so nothing is reachable, but
# the production app is path-scoped to /admin.html and /api/*, which would make
# every file below publicly fetchable on vivianbakes.com after the cutover.
.DS_Store
images/archive/
images/tmp/
